Keep oldest, retained, next_sequence, overwritten, and the 16 records under one
spinlock.
For a non-full append, use (oldest + retained) % capacity.
For a full append, replace oldest, advance oldest, and increment overwritten.

The show callback copies a complete bounded snapshot under the lock, unlocks,
then formats it.
Let the shared append path record task_pid_nr(current).
Call the typed functions only after a successful credential change or a selected
rmdir return.
